{"2752090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SCP New Management", "steam_appid": 2752090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Welcome Site-Director!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In the world of the SCP Foundation, horror and bureaucracy exist in an uneasy balance. Hidden across the globe, top-secret facilities and underground bunkers contain anomalies that must never reach the outside world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your predecessor was terminated, and your superiors have made it clear that their mistakes cannot be repeated. Unfortunately, keeping monsters contained is never as simple as it sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752090/extras/04c5d52984e2e7acdf9f28ffcf88ccf8.avif?t=1787538090\" width=918 height=78 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Contain unpredictable and often dangerous anomalies, otherwise known as SCPs, that get sent to your facility. Perform experiments to unlock new procedures, gather knowledge, and level up your site.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752090/extras/0cdcc337da1f5ebd57510c46134e1f5f.poster.avif?t=1787538090\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752090/extras/0cdcc337da1f5ebd57510c46134e1f5f.webm?t=1787538090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752090/extras/0cdcc337da1f5ebd57510c46134e1f5f.mp4?t=1787538090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The anomalies inhabiting this game includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-049 // Plague Doctor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-079 // Old AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-096 // The Shy Guy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-106 // The Old Man</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-173 // The Sculpture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-500 // Panacea</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-682 // The Indestructible Lizard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-939 // With Many Voices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCP-999 // The Tickle Monster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more- yet to be announced!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752090/extras/153bc0aded0c7f5c91e1852853f28755.avif?t=1787538090\" width=918 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Design and build your new facility to meet the Foundation’s growing demands. Expands your site in all three dimensions, balancing space, efficiency, and security as more challenges arise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752090/extras/f5c6a10d2294edddd49d624839cb36b1.poster.avif?t=1787538090\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752090/extras/f5c6a10d2294edddd49d624839cb36b1.webm?t=1787538090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752090/extras/f5c6a10d2294edddd49d624839cb36b1.mp4?t=1787538090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start building above ground and descend into multiple subterranean levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct your containment facility and customize every room </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through the research tree to unlock new structures, actions and items</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752090/extras/11b5bdd454b1920e08f05a3b895987bb.avif?t=1787538090\" width=918 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Balance your economy, fend off invading rival organizations, and handle containment breaches. There is a lot at stake and humanity depends on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752090/extras/79c9945dce5db8dda286bfe0a72e70d8.poster.avif?t=1787538090\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752090/extras/79c9945dce5db8dda286bfe0a72e70d8.webm?t=1787538090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752090/extras/79c9945dce5db8dda286bfe0a72e70d8.mp4?t=1787538090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your budget carefully while expanding and maintaining your facility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect your site from rival organizations, insurgents, and other threats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire, equip and assign workers with the right items</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752090/extras/2b706aacc89a2d5900fbaed2c655a2c5.avif?t=1787538090\" width=919 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Great job Site-Director, you made it to the end! You are now officially a part of the foundation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Join our Discord (located in the <strong>details tab), </strong>and grab yourself a slice of pizza! &lt;3</p>", "about_the